  "details": "PhysBone grab states do not sync across different client branches (Live and Open Beta). Standard physbones collisions and movement sync properly over the network, active grabs are completely de-synced to users on the other branch.\n\nThe user grabbing sees the physbone move normally, while the user on the other client branch sees no interaction happen at all.\n\nI have only tested this on PCVR, so I am unsure if this also occurs the other platforms.",
